		"spell_hweiww_tooltip": "Hwei paints a protective pool at the target location that lasts for @spell.HweiWW:AreaDuration@ seconds granting an immediate <shield>@spell.HweiW:Tooltip_WWStartShieldAmount@ Shields</shield>, increasing up to <shield>@spell.HweiW:Tooltip_WWShieldAmount@ Shields</shield> over @spell.HweiWW:SecsToFullStack@ seconds to allied champions in the area reduced by @spell.HweiWW:ToolTipAllyMod*100@% for allies.",
		"spell_hweiwe_tooltip": "Hwei paints three swirling lights that circle him causing his next three Abilities or Attacks to deal an additional <magicDamage>@spell.HweiW:Tooltip_WEOnHitDamage@ magic damage</magicDamage> and grant <scaleMana>@spell.HweiW:Tooltip_WEOnHitManaRestore@ Mana</scaleMana> on hit.",
