		"spell_hweiew_tooltip": "Hwei paints an abyssal eye at the target location that grants vision, locking onto the nearest enemy champion and launches a homing missile at them <status>Rooting</status> the first enemy in its path for @spell.HweiE:Tooltip_EWRootDuration@ seconds and dealing <magicDamage>@spell.HweiE:Tooltip_EWDamage@ magic damage</magicDamage>.",
